/E (The FCRA, 2010 regulates acceptance and utilisation of foreign contribution and foreign hospitality by individuals, associations and companies, to ensure that such inflows do not adversely affect national interest, public order or national security, and that they are utilised for the purpose for which they are received. )
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
875 0 obj
<<
