893 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1822 0 R
/E (Schedule of permissible purposes: The amended Rules specify 22 activities under the educational category \(with a qualifier that awareness programmes on constitutional rights/fundamental duties/civic responsibilities must be 'strictly non-political in nature'\), 18 categories under cultural purpose \(including 'promotion of contemporary arts inspired by Indian traditions', excluding political or ideological content\), 16 categories of religious activity \(including religious education, moral instruction, satsangs, discourses and meditation retreats, but explicitly excluding proselytisation, and including burial/cremation ground development\), 19 categories under the economic purpose, and 30 items under the social category.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
894 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1823 0 R
/E (One-year transition window: Associations already FCRA-registered before 22 June 2026 must, within one year \(by 21 June 2027\), file Form FC-6F specifying the purpose\(s\) and State\(s\)/UT\(s\) for which they seek to retain registration.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
895 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1824 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
896 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1825 0 R
/E (Foreign key functionaries: Codifies \(previously informal FAQ-based\) guidance that associations with foreign nationals \(other than persons of Indian origin\) as key functionaries will ordinarily require specific prior government approval, subject to case-by-case exceptions.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
897 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1826 0 R
/E (Enhanced disclosure \(Form FC-4\): Mandatory disclosure of social media accounts and websites, and a declaration on whether the association or its key functionaries have brought out any publication \(books, magazines, newspaper articles\) during the year.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
898 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1827 0 R
/E (Tighter instalment-release conditions \(new Rule 9A\): For prior-permission grantees, release of a second or subsequent instalment of foreign contribution now requires filing Form FC-3BB, utilisation of at least 75% of the previous instalment, a field inquiry by the Ministry, a CA-certified utilisation certificate, bank statements and a photographic activity report.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
